WEBVTT

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:11.880
<i>I thought growing older 
would turn me into an adult.</i>

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.010
Ko-chan,

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:14.830
how do I look?

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:18.890
You laughed!

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:21.230
Suits really aren't your thing.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:27.750
<i>I believed I'd find 
work, get married,</i>

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.700
<i>and become an adult.</i>

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.760
But none of those things have happened.<i></i>

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.340
Come on, everyone.

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.760
Don't do that.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.310
What?

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:43.770
<i>Even though I've grown older,</i>

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.770
<i>I feel like nothing's changed.</i>

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:54.960
<i>I've still never truly felt 
like I've become an adult.</i>

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.410
This smells like the perfect crime to me.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.780
The room was locked at 
the time of the crime.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.700
There are no traces of a 
weapon or fingerprints.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:30.760
Then, how did the victim die?

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:33.510
This bookcase...

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:36.670
Didn't they say that the vic
often frequented the library?

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:37.670
Yes.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:39.710
Take a look at this book.

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:42.180
Hey, what are they talking about?

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.310
There's nothing unusual about it.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.540
We examined this book and this one too,

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.720
but the book the vic borrowed 
from the library last week...

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:52.790
Huh?

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:55.080
Hey! What's going on?

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:56.650
Shut up already!

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.330
How many times have you carried 
on talking since we started watching?

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.500
Just shut up and watch.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:01.390
If I shut up and watch,

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:03.270
I don't understand anything. 
That's why I'm asking.

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:06.400
I can't focus on the show.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:09.400
I can't focus on the...

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:11.660
I can't...

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.460
What are you doing?!

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.010
Come on!

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:16.500
Just shut up and watch, monkey!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.220
He's right, Chizuru-kun.

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:20.750
It's about to get really interesting.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.370
I can't hear anything over the 
noise you guys are making.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.430
I'm going to rewind it.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:30.480
Ikegami-san, it was you!

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.240
Where's your proof?

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:36.980
Sorry, I fast-forwarded.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:38.920
Great, it's over.

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.500
The mystery's been solved. 
Clap, clap, clap, clap, clap.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:44.790
I guess this movie was a swing and a miss.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.950
This group's a swing and a miss!

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:50.590
Whose bright idea was it to watch 
movies at my place on Christmas Eve?!

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:53.740
We don't have the money to go out.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:56.500
And you have the biggest TV.

00:03:58.570 --> 00:03:59.990
What should we do now?

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:03.040
That was the last DVD we rented.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.340
We'll go rent some more, of course.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.980
This'll be our DVD Christmas.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:11.320
Our Christmas Eve's 
just getting started.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:14.030
Don't count on sleeping tonight.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:15.310
Especially you, Kanamecchi.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.660
I bet you're planning on talking 
to me while we're watching again.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:18.690
Let me just watch in peace.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:22.440
Let's watch the next one normally.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:25.950
<b>Step Street</b>

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:25.950
Three, two, one...

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:28.020
Did you get your photo?

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:30.000
Okay, let's switch up the order.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.820
Huh? Where's Kanamecchi?

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:34.990
The next subject is: A maiden in love.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:37.640
You gotta be in the photo with us.

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:39.150
We already got our DVDs.

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:40.570
There's nothing else for us here.

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:41.940
Let's go already.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.930
Now, now.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:44.630
I don't...

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.380
Come on, come on.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:49.350
Kanamecchi, you better 
give us a peace sign.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.780
How cute.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.840
Like hell I will.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:53.170
Why do we have to take 
these pictures, anyway?

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.470
Say "cheese."

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:56.350
I bet you've never done this before.

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.350
Three, two, one...

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:59.590
All the cool kids are doing it.

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:02.250
If you don't take a few pictures 
at least, you'll be left behind.

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.770
You're the one who's been left behind
 if you're calling us "cool kids."

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:05.810
Here comes the next one.

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:08.620
Peace signs, everyone.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:11.270
Kaname-kun, aren't you going to do it?

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.200
How cute.

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:13.770
What? You're terrible, Kanamecchi.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:13.700
Say "cheese."

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.410
Fine.

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.600
Three, two, one...

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.540
Kaname, you're so embarrassing.

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:22.440
The Student Council's gonna 
have a GBH scandal on their hands.

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:23.470
Whose fault is that?

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:27.050
Can't we get a nice picture together?

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:29.610
We're supposed to choose from these?

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:31.900
This one is pretty good.

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:33.160
What does this button do?

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.360
Skin whitening?

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:37.150
Does this one make our eyes bigger?

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:38.910
Let's try it.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:38.910
I'll be outside.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:41.930
What's wrong?

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.960
Nothing.

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:48.960
Azuma-sensei.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.080
Huh? Azuma-sensei? Where?

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:54.330
Azuma-sensei!

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.460
Oh, Tachibana-kun. You're all here.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.110
Buy us some pork buns.

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:01.690
Show us growing boys some love.

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:04.900
Pork buns won't make you any taller.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.210
Where have you been?

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:07.520
A store over there.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:09.240
Their croquettes looked good.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.890
Don't just disappear like that.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.860
That's the guy from the culture festival.

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:16.160
The festival...

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:18.960
Chocolate Banana!

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.500
Chocolate Banana? 
What is he talking about?

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:22.650
Who knows?

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.260
What are you doing here?

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:27.400
I can go wherever I want.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.280
What are you guys doing here?

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.410
We came to rent some—

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.670
Shun-chan, you don't have to answer him.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:35.130
Not only did he cut in line 
at the culture festival,

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:38.290
but this jerk also insulted my height.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.770
You did that?

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:42.540
Who cares? It's all in the past.

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:43.840
I care!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.890
We have no idea what's going on.

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:50.300
Azuma-sensei, how do you know him?

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.240
Oh, right.

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:57.880
I wanted to tell you at the 
festival, but I guess I forgot.

00:06:57.880 --> 00:06:59.700
He's my friend.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.680
I'm Akira.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:03.560
Are you guys Ko-chan's students?

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.130
Your friend?

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.570
Ko-chan?

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:09.040
We went to the same high school.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.240
Homare High School.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.610
I'm your senior.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:13.910
What?

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:18.380
Azuma-sensei, you went 
to Homare High School?

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:20.390
Yes, actually.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:23.880
And this guy's your age?

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.920
I thought he was around our age.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.690
I know, right?

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:29.980
I've got a baby face,

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:32.250
so people always think 
I'm younger than I am.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:35.930
Your face isn't the only reason 
people think you're young.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:39.620
Since I'm your senior, I expect 
you to show me some respect.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.110
Especially you, Shorty.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:43.650
Don't call me Shorty!

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.270
I see.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.600
You were taking some pictures together.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.500
Oh, Sensei. Do you want 
one of our pictures?

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:52.280
Are you sure?

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.960
Stick it on your phone so that you can 
keep a watchful eye on your dear students.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:07:59.130
Hey, no fair.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:00.920
Give me one so I can put it on my phone.

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:02.170
No way!

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:04.500
I bet you'd stick it on a voodoo doll.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.210
I wouldn't do that.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:09.880
By the way, you're looking 
rather dapper today, Sensei.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:10.710
Yeah.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:14.510
I went to a friend's wedding today.

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:19.640
Getting married on Christmas 
Eve sounds wonderful.

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:22.940
I know. Apparently, it's a 
marriage between coworkers.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.830
What about you, Azuma-sensei?

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:26.620
Are you gonna marry a coworker?

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:27.940
Maybe.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:30.660
Maybe? Azuma-sensei...

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.290
Don't tell us you see your 
own students that way.

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:34.740
That's not what I meant.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.440
Akira-san, what do you do for a living?

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:38.840
Huh? Me?

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:40.950
I'm Santa Claus.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:44.390
A black-hearted Santa dressed 
all in red would make kids cry.

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:46.250
Well, my shift's starting soon.

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.380
Don't ignore me!

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:51.930
Akira-san's sorta cute, isn't he?

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:55.620
He's an adult, but he 
talks like a small child.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:58.550
I'm pretty sure he's actually still a child.

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:02.720
He <i>says</i> he's Santa Claus, 
but I bet he's lying.

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:05.220
He must've run away because 
he couldn't handle it.

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:08.110
I should get going.

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:11.420
This will probably be the last 
time I see you boys this year,

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:12.690
so have a happy new year.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:15.170
Oh, right. Happy new year.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:16.770
Happy new year.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.010
We should go, too.

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:20.640
I'm getting cold.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:21.750
You're right.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.600
We got our pork buns,

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:26.120
so let's pick up our DVD 
Christmas where we...

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:34.630
What's wrong?

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.040
Are you lost?

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.280
Did you fall?

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:41.620
Is that your balloon?

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:44.710
My balloon flew away.

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:46.560
Is that right?

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.540
All right!

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.590
We'll get your balloon for you.

00:09:49.590 --> 00:09:50.830
"We"?

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.140
Yukki, gimme a boost!

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:58.740
Just a little further.

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.640
You can do it.

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:02.400
Just get it already.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.850
Why don't you help them?

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.830
He's the one who said he'd get it.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:13.070
Yukki, hold it steady.

00:10:13.070 --> 00:10:14.410
Are you all right?

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:15.390
Yeah.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.500
Don't drop me.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.840
Even if you lose your 
balance, don't drop me.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.970
Don't drop you?

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.790
I'm not playing around.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.960
I'm serious. Don't drop me.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:27.060
You seriously don't want me to drop you?

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.800
I just told you! I'm not kidding.

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:31.470
Huh? What are you guys doing?

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:33.960
Um... The balloon...

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.190
Akira-san?

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.740
What? Chocolate Banana?

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:42.410
Chizuru, if you keep squirming 
like that, I really will...

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.430
Why are we dressed like this?

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:07.640
Surely you didn't expect to get off 
scot-free after ruining our event?

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.600
You'll be working hard to repay us.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.570
Of course.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:12.850
With you guys around,

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:15.090
not only do you make it impossible
 to watch DVDs undisturbed,

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:17.540
but I can't even watch 
them in the first place.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:19.570
Is this a woman's costume?

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:22.280
Our Christmas Eve plans!

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.060
What were you guys doing?

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.040
Shut up!

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.590
What do you think <i>you're</i> doing?

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:32.290
You shouldn't go cosplaying 
around the city, you bum!

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:34.820
How rude.

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:37.760
I'm not playing around. This is my job.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:38.680
Right?

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:41.650
It's your fault for arriving 
late, Akira-chan.

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:43.630
Thanks for helping us out again.

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:46.210
We even hired a reindeer this year.

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:50.480
Hey!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:54.990
Akira-san, seriously now, 
what are you doing?

00:11:58.770 --> 00:12:00.140
Thank you.

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:03.450
Mom, Santa gave me a new balloon.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:09.810
Make sure you hold on tight this time.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.030
Okay.

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:13.210
Not to Yuta's hand.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:16.150
Those twins sure are popular.

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:18.300
Well, <i>sorry</i> for not being as popular as them.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:20.770
What're you talking about?

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.430
Looks like you're really popular as well,

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:23.510
if you know what I mean.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:24.420
Shut up.

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:26.170
His hair's weird.

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.640
I wonder if we can see her panties.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.320
Can you see them?

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:33.670
Stop it!

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:35.170
You're shaking the ladder!

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:37.110
Santa's scared.

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:39.860
U-Um, excuse me.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:43.030
Can you do something 
about these kids for me?

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:45.360
Hey!

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:50.370
Real reindeer aren't on 
great terms with Santa, are they?

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:52.310
Sensei.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:53.960
Sensei? You're right.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:55.330
Sensei?

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.600
Sensei, Sensei.

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:59.020
Yes, yes. Hold on.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:03.810
Ch-Chocolate Banana, are you an 
elementary school teacher?

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:06.920
Of course not. I'm Santa Claus.

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:08.680
Here you go. One for each of you.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.250
Yeah, but they just...

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:12.020
It's Santa.

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:15.230
It's the real Santa.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:17.370
Merry Christmas.

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:20.430
Santa's got a present for all 
you good little boys and girls.

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:24.160
What about the reindeer? 
Where are the reindeer?

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.590
Oh, my reindeer like to run free.

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:30.700
Don't talk about the 
reindeer like a dog.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:34.350
I know. I'll give you some
 of my caramel, Santa.

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:35.660
It's really good.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.670
Thank you.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.730
Nonta, you're such a baby.

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.150
There's no way he's the real Santa.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.180
Huh?

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:46.180
He's just a normal guy 
dressed up like Santa.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:47.020
What?

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:49.670
You're wrong. He's the real Santa.

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:51.540
He's even got a white beard.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.930
That's right. H-How dare you 
make such an accusation?!

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:57.840
But that Santa Claus isn't even fat.

00:13:57.840 --> 00:14:00.560
Santa's keeping an eye on his figure.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:02.280
Right, Santa?

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:06.450
Chocolate Banana, what are you doing?

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:07.500
Are you stupid?

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:09.440
What do you think you're doing?

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:10.620
It'll be fine.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.450
It's just one caramel.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.150
I'm not talking about sugar!

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:16.070
Just put your beard back on!

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:18.820
The caramel will get stuck to it.

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:21.960
Oh, right. I haven't given 
you your present yet.

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:31.390
Liar.

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:32.180
Huh?

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.140
I don't want your present!

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:37.430
Wait, you dropped your caramel!

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:41.480
What a careless kid.

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:46.470
Yeah. But, at least his carelessness is 
ten thousand times cuter than yours.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:55.950
I'm exhausted. I'm finished with this.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.990
Kaname-kun, you sabotaged us.

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:07.210
No, I didn't.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.860
The event's almost over, 
so they said I could take a break.

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:12.220
Huh? Really? It's over?

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:17.350
Chizuru, you seem more 
worn out than the rest of us.

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.260
Of course I am.

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:21.700
I've been with the living
eighth wonder of the world.

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:23.730
There you are.

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.240
Good work, boys.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:27.660
We'll take care of the rest, 
so you can go home.

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:28.990
Seriously?!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:31.240
Thank you for all your help.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:35.120
You can help yourselves 
to some free candy.

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.720
Really? Really?!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.590
Finders keepers.

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:43.580
Yukki, no fair.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:44.860
Huh?

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:45.590
What's wrong?

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.480
There's none left.

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:50.070
Huh? That's odd.

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:52.590
I thought there was still loads left.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:55.520
Why don't you help 
out again next year?

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:57.350
You might get some next time.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.400
Good work, guys.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.990
Akira-chan, come again next year.

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:05.560
Good work.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.820
This smells like the perfect crime.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:12.940
The perfect... what?

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:15.050
I can't be bothered to 
correct you right now,

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:16.830
so you're on your own.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.890
Listen up, boys.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.580
The candy didn't just disappear.

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:24.580
It was stolen!

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:28.590
There isn't a single fingerprint 
at the scene of the crime.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:32.340
There's no record of you checking 
for fingerprints, either.

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:35.960
Naturally, no one saw the 
perp wipe off his prints.

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.220
Which means...

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:41.190
The perp must have been wearing gloves!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.970
We're all wearing gloves.

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.330
Wh-What?

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.230
What are you trying to do?

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.740
What I'm trying to say...

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:53.370
is that Chocolate Banana's 
our prime suspect.

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:56.260
In that white Santa sack of his,

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:58.200
he's got the madness and 
maliciousness known as a desire...

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.590
for candy and hunger.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:01.630
Also, it's <i>our</i> candy in there!

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:05.300
Where are you going?

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:06.420
Let go!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.720
Chocolate Banana, show yourself!

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.510
You want that candy 
more than anyone else.

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.920
What's wrong? Is everything all right?

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.540
Sorry, he's just tired.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:19.410
Let go!

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:21.480
You've seen how he acts.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:23.180
It's gotta be him.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:23.180
No, Chizuru-kun.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:24.230
You shouldn't accuse him based on that.

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:25.340
Shut up!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:30.950
I'm sorry.

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:32.440
The reindeer?

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.600
This smells like the perfect crime.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.700
Hey, not you, too.

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:47.170
We're not the only ones who 
wouldn't leave fingerprints.

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:49.840
I told you, the Chocolate Banana...

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:51.250
There's someone else.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.100
No. No way.

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:56.320
It couldn't have been the reindeer.

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:01.140
The candy...

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.350
Excuse me.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:08.530
Stop it.

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:10.310
J-Just take this off.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.710
What are you doing with all of this?

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:17.030
Those are our goods.

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:18.480
He ran away.

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:19.660
Chase him, quickly!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.260
Chizuru.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:22.330
M-Me?

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.290
Where's my caramel?

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.920
Outta the way!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.670
Watch out!

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.030
Are you all right?

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:56.580
That was a bit of a surprise, wasn't it?

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:58.550
Here.

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:01.160
A present from Santa 
for being a good little boy.

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:03.160
Have a merry, merry Christmas.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.120
Thanks, Santa.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.530
You're welcome.

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:13.470
Bye bye!

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.670
Chocolate Banana...

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:17.670
Who <i>are</i> you?

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:21.140
I'm Santa Claus.

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:26.140
This day has been exhausting.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.990
Why did I have to work so 
hard on Christmas Eve?

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:31.380
Because you knocked the tree over.

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:34.050
No, it's because...

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:37.120
It's because you suggested 
we rent more DVDs.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:38.710
No matter how far you go back,

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:41.210
it always comes back to Chizuru.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.660
Come on.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.540
You guys wanted to watch more, too.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.740
What should we do about the DVDs?

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:49.660
Do you want to call it a night?

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.400
Of course not.

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:53.200
Our time starts now.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:54.880
Our DVD Christmas!

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:58.550
But I don't see the DVDs anywhere.

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.180
Kanamecchi, do you know where they are?

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:02.330
How would I know?

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:03.320
I don't know.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:04.690
I don't know.

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:06.230
Me, neither.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:11.100
They might still be at the mall.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.200
What?

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:17.890
This is so terrible, 
I can't even yell at you.

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.440
What is this?

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:21.870
I hear jingle bells ringing in my head.

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:24.030
Yuki-kun, that's called a headache.

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:27.790
Who could that be at this hour?

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:30.310
Maybe it's Santa.

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:35.380
Shun-chan, we graduated from 
believing in Santa long ago.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.210
Here.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:42.480
Our DVDs!

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:44.960
Akira found them.

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:47.440
You left them in the event space.

00:20:47.440 --> 00:20:49.660
You should be grateful.

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:54.140
Thank you, but how did 
you know they were ours?

00:20:54.510 --> 00:20:57.000
Because they were in the picture.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:02.260
Santa!

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:04.520
I thought you just said 
you'd graduated from that.

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:08.110
Are you sure?

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:12.320
As long as you're here, 
you should enjoy yourself.

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.160
Are you sure you're sure?

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:15.750
It looks like you were having fun.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.250
It's fine, it's fine.

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:18.920
We've been running around all over the place,

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.670
so we're just getting started.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:22.830
Do you drink coffee, Sensei?

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.260
Yes, please.

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.430
I'll have a hot cocoa.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.180
I didn't ask you!

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:32.390
I hope we can actually do 
something fun next Christmas.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.810
Maybe we'll do something 
a little luxurious.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:39.280
By luxurious, I bet you just mean 
we'll have a parfait each.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:41.880
You underestimate me. 
We'll have <i>two</i> each.

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:42.970
That's hardly different.

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:44.610
They're so carefree.

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:46.220
Now, now, Chizuru-kun.

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:46.220
Won't they be in the middle...

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:48.320
of their entrance exams this time next year?

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:52.890
Yeah, but you can't imagine it,

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:55.080
until you experience it.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.330
Is that right?

00:21:58.340 --> 00:22:02.630
<i>I thought growing older 
would turn me into an adult.</i>

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:07.880
<i>I believed I would find 
work, get married,</i>

00:22:07.880 --> 00:22:09.820
<i>and become an adult.</i>

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:13.350
<b>Cocoa</b>

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:13.350
<i>But none of those things have happened.</i>

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:16.470
Are you jealous of them?

00:22:16.470 --> 00:22:17.980
Maybe.

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:20.890
I guess we'll have to be 
high schoolers again.

00:22:20.890 --> 00:22:22.260
You're right.

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>I've still never truly felt that 
I've become an adult.</i>

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:33.660
<i>But I'm no longer a child.</i>

00:24:16.930 --> 00:24:19.870
In The Steam

00:24:16.930 --> 00:24:19.870
Next time: In The Steam.
